1
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:14,480
Oh, no.

2
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,680
Zhiyan,

3
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,239
I'll be right back.

4
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,640
Your Highness, please spare me.

5
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,599
I...

6
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:47,959
I really don't know where the princess consort went.

7
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:52,400
I saw the princess consort fall asleep last night,

8
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,680
then I left.

9
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:56,239
When I came to wake her up just now,

10
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,000
I found

11
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,400
she was gone.

12
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,000
Don't think I don't know

13
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,439
what tricks you are playing.

14
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:04,000
You'd better be honest.

15
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,480
Otherwise, you'll be punished.

16
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,599
You guys go find the princess consort.

17
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,759
If you can't find her,

18
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,319
don't come back.

19
00:02:11,759 --> 00:02:12,240
Yes.

20
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,000
What are you doing here?

21
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,639
Do you need me to teach you how to find her?

22
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,360
Go!

23
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:30,840
Butterfly.

24
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,560
Butterfly.

25
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,360
Butterfly.

26
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,800
Where is the butterfly?

27
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,159
Butterfly.

28
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,360
Shen Suhe.

29
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,319
What are you doing?

30
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,560
Let me go.

31
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,680
I can't find the butterfly.

32
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,800
What are you doing?

33
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,120
Butterfly?

34
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,159
Princess consort.

35
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:50,159
It's princess consort.

36
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:54,319
Princess consort, you're back.

37
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,759
You ran out without telling me.

38
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,280
Why didn't you tell me?

39
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,319
You can't sneak out anymore.

40
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,240
Do you know?

41
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:02,479
There are bad people outside.

42
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:03,680
Bad people who eat people.

43
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,680
But

44
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,400
my butterfly is missing.

45
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:12,199
I... I need to find it.

46
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,319
Where is it?

47
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:14,280
Princess,

48
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,879
let me take you back to freshen up first.

49
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,639
Then we can go catch butterflies together.

50
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:19,479
Okay?

51
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:20,599
Can we still find it?

52
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,240
Yes.

53
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,240
Alright then.

54
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,439
This is the Prime Minister's Residence.

55
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:04,960
The Prime Minister's Residence.

56
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,400
Thank you, Mr. Shen,

57
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,720
for saving me.

58
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,839
No need to thank me.

59
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,279
It was my sister who insisted on bringing you back to heal.

60
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,079
It seems you know it was she who brought you back.

61
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,000
Then I assume

62
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,480
you must know her background.

63
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,600
Forgive me for speaking frankly.

64
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,279
the wounds on your body

65
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,639
are mostly caused by sharp blades.

66
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:36,079
And the palms of your hands

67
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,399
are calloused.

68
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,199
You

69
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:42,639
are definitely not an ordinary person.

70
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,480
My sister grew up in the Prime Minister's Residence.

71
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:47,319
She is kind-hearted

72
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,120
and naive.

73
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,800
She and you

74
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,600
are not the same kind.

75
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,720
Mr. Shen, rest assured,

76
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,360
I only

77
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:57,720
met your sister a few times.

78
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,519
We're not close.

79
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,040
We won't

80
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:03,199
meet much in the future.

81
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:04,959
That's good.

82
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:07,279
In the entire mansion,

83
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:09,279
only I know you're here to heal.

84
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,800
So I can't

85
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,680
let you stay over.

86
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:14,959
Thank you.

87
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,959
I hope you keep your promise

88
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:19,959
and stop bothering my sister.

89
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:24,639
This is from Sui'er.

90
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:30,040
Breakfast is ready.

91
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,199
The servants have been dismissed.

92
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:34,800
After you eat,

93
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:35,959
you can leave on your own.

94
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:45,959
Sui'er.

95
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:42,720
Isn't this General Defending the State?

96
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,360
Haven't you heard?

97
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:47,399
General Xiao used to be invincible.

98
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,480
But recently, in a battle,

99
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:50,759
his entire army was wiped out.

100
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,399
He was even missing for a while.

101
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:54,040
In my opinion,

102
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,439
he must have defected to the enemy.

103
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:56,920
Yeah.

104
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,680
Yeah.

105
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:00,360
Why did you tear it?

106
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,399
I've served the empire for years,

107
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:07,879
and I've never been disloyal.

108
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:09,680
But I was slandered

109
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,680
just because of a defeat.

110
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,199
I must go to the Emperor

111
00:07:13,319 --> 00:07:14,279
to explain it clearly.

112
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:15,319
Qianzhi,

113
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,879
now that you know there's someone behind it,

114
00:07:19,399 --> 00:07:20,079
you should know

115
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:22,480
this is just to lure you out.

116
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,560
Don't be impulsive.

117
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,600
Settle down first,

118
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,639
then we'll make a plan.

119
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:29,879
Prince Yu,

120
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,160
we've been together on the border for years.

121
00:07:32,639 --> 00:07:34,040
You should know my character.

122
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:37,319
I'm not afraid of tens of thousands of enemies.

123
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:39,560
How could I be afraid of a treacherous villain?

124
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:42,199
If I hide here,

125
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,079
and live a precarious life,

126
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,439
where should those soldiers

127
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:47,319
who fought with me go?

128
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,120
Can I just watch them

129
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:52,120
bear this false accusation because of me?

130
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:52,759
Brother,

131
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,160
you know I didn't mean that.

132
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:57,240
The enemy hasn't shown up yet.

133
00:07:57,759 --> 00:07:58,959
It's the best choice

134
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,000
to stay put.

135
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:02,000
When I know who's behind it,

136
00:08:02,319 --> 00:08:03,519
we'll crush them all at once.

137
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,240
Although

138
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,439
His Majesty is suspicious,

139
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,399
he's not stupid.

140
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:12,959
Without concrete evidence,

141
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,439
he won't jump to conclusions.

142
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,680
My brother, think back,

143
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,000
is there any evidence

144
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,279
that might be in someone else's hands?

145
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,800
Now that you mention it,

146
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,079
there is indeed something fishy.

147
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,720
On that day of defeat,

148
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:27,399
I was captured by the enemy.

149
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,800
I endured torture day and night.

150
00:08:31,199 --> 00:08:33,120
Later, I managed to escape.

151
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,919
But I can't recall

152
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,840
what happened during those days.

153
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,240
I vaguely remember

154
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,480
they forced me

155
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,720
to sign something.

156
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,720
You have experienced hundreds of battles.

157
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,960
How can ordinary torture

158
00:08:47,159 --> 00:08:48,159
harm you?

159
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,759
They must have used some special means.

160
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:52,919
It's taro powder.

161
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,799
Your Highness, do you remember

162
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,639
the acupuncture kit you gave me some time ago?

163
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:57,759
This morning,

164
00:08:57,919 --> 00:08:59,159
Dr. Xue sent a message back,

165
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:00,559
saying that the silver needles

166
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:01,600
were all poisoned,

167
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:02,759
named Taro powder,

168
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:03,960
produced in the West Shu,

169
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,480
which can be used to anesthetize the senses,

170
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,279
and also used in witchcraft to hallucinate people.

171
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:08,759
Every year, the West Shu

172
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:10,159
will make a small tribute to the palace.

173
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,919
Based on General Xiao's statement,

174
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,240
it's very likely that he was poisoned.

175
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:14,879
Taro powder?

176
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,799
Could the mastermind

177
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,120
be the Second Prince?

178
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,519
I have never met him before,

179
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:22,440
and hold no grudges against him.

180
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,200
Why would the Second Prince

181
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:26,039
frame me?

182
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:28,799
I remember that you

183
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,080
were close to Prime Minister Shen,

184
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,960
and occasionally exchange letters.

185
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,320
That was many years ago.

186
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,840
Why do you ask?

187
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,360
We have been fighting at the border for a long time,

188
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,240
and are not familiar with the court affairs.

189
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,279
Do you know that the Second Prince

190
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:44,360
and Prime Minister Shen are arch-enemies at the court?

191
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,639
He is not targeting you,

192
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,759
but using you

193
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:49,080
as a pawn to bring down Prime Minister Shen.

194
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,480
By the way,

195
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:51,919
I also found

196
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:53,279
a pharmaceutical factory

197
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,440
named "Great Apricot Pharmacy" in the city.

198
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,320
It seems to have secretly developed this poison.

199
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,120
The owner of this pharmacy

200
00:09:58,639 --> 00:09:59,759
is a counselor of the Second Prince.

201
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:15,799
Miss,

202
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,919
what's in this letter?

203
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,840
The poison

204
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,799
is indeed made by Mu Jinghao.

205
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,320
I need to get out of here.

206
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,080
The Second Prince ordered that

207
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:31,279
you can't leave the mansion.

208
00:10:32,399 --> 00:10:33,840
How can you get out?

209
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,440
He sent this secret letter to me,

210
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,000
which means

211
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:39,919
this mansion

212
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,759
is not completely sealed off.

213
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:46,960
Zhiyan.

214
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,240
Have you

215
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,600
seen a golden hairpin

216
00:10:58,639 --> 00:10:59,600
a golden hairpin around here?

217
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:03,440
That's the princess consort's most precious hairpin.

218
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:05,200
She hasn't left the mansion these days.

219
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:07,240
It must be in this yard.

220
00:11:07,759 --> 00:11:08,200
You guys,

221
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,480
hurry up and find it!

222
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,759
His Highness instructed us before leaving

223
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,960
to stay here and guard this place.

224
00:11:14,279 --> 00:11:15,200
I've told you,

225
00:11:15,559 --> 00:11:16,320
that hairpin

226
00:11:16,519 --> 00:11:18,240
must be in some corner of this mansion.

227
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,360
You know

228
00:11:19,559 --> 00:11:20,480
the princess consort's temper.

229
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:23,039
If she starts making a fuss

230
00:11:23,039 --> 00:11:23,799
because we can't find that hairpin,

231
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,360
don't blame me for not warning you.

232
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:27,840
Where could it have fallen?

233
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:28,840
Zhiyan,

234
00:11:29,039 --> 00:11:30,679
do you know what that hairpin looks like?

235
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:32,679
About this long,

236
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,639
with a crabapple blossom on the end.

237
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,840
I remember the princess consort played there before.

238
00:11:38,039 --> 00:11:38,879
You go there to find it.

239
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:39,919
Go!

240
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,200
Look carefully.

241
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:47,840
Look carefully.

242
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,159
Don't miss any corners.

243
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:51,720
Look carefully.

244
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:58,840
Miss

245
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:00,480
Can we do this?

246
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,279
Cut the crap.

247
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:02,879
Squat down.

248
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,720
Can we really do this?

249
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:09,639
Come on.

250
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:10,840
Come on.

251
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,240
What's going on?

252
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,279
I found it.

253
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,159
Here it is.

254
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:33,279
Go ahead.

255
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,240
Go.

256
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,679
Prince Rui's Mansion is heavily guarded.

257
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,960
Not even a fly can get out.

258
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,720
I thought the princess consort wouldn't show up.

259
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,159
I have my way.

260
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,440
Don't bother.

261
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:52,600
Can you act?

262
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,559
I'm sure I'm not worse than you.

263
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:12,919
Sir,

264
00:13:13,519 --> 00:13:14,639
what medicine do you want?

265
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,000
What illness do you want to cure?

266
00:13:16,679 --> 00:13:19,440
My Lord has no other hobbies,

267
00:13:19,799 --> 00:13:21,320
but loves to study pharmacology,

268
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:23,840
especially some rare and strange medicines.

269
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,399
I don't think your shop is big enough.

270
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:28,440
I don't know if you can find what we want.

271
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,080
Look at you.

272
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:30,840
Our shop

273
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:31,960
is small,

274
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:33,399
but it's well-equipped.

275
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:35,519
If we don't have the medicine,

276
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:36,679
then the entire Kyoto,

277
00:13:36,799 --> 00:13:38,279
including the imperial palace, can't find it.

278
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:39,200
Really?

279
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,240
Then take a look,

280
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,399
do you have

281
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,000
do you have them?

282
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,159
May I ask

283
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:51,159
what these herbs are for?

284
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,919
Many of these herbs

285
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,080
aren't even native to the Grand Commandant.

286
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,320
I've already said,

287
00:13:56,399 --> 00:13:58,120
our master loves studying herbal medicine.

288
00:13:58,639 --> 00:13:59,440
Would he bother coming here

289
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,759
for ordinary herbs?

290
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,360
If you have them,

291
00:14:02,799 --> 00:14:04,679
I'm willing to pay double.

292
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:05,960
But if

293
00:14:06,279 --> 00:14:07,440
you dare to lie to me,

294
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:08,399
I'll make you

295
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,279
pay back a hundred times.

296
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,360
You're joking.

297
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,720
We never dare to

298
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:14,039
sell fake medicine.

299
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,000
Please wait a moment.

300
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,120
I'll ask the owner.

301
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:41,720
What a coincidence!

302
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,919
We just received

303
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,279
a batch of herbs recently.

304
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,000
The ones you're looking for

305
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,919
are all included.

306
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,720
But these herbs

307
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,279
aren't usually in demand,

308
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,679
so they're stored in the herb repository.

309
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:53,600
Please follow me.

310
00:15:06,159 --> 00:15:06,799
You two,

311
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,080
wait a moment.

312
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:15,559
Take a look,

313
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,799
is this the herb you're looking for?

314
00:15:21,559 --> 00:15:22,759
Looks like we're in the right place.

315
00:15:23,159 --> 00:15:24,720
Pack all of these for us.

316
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:25,600
No problem.

317
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,279
I think

318
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,279
you must have

319
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:32,200
some rare treasures here.

320
00:15:32,399 --> 00:15:33,039
Would it be

321
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,799
possible for us to take a look inside?

322
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,519
I'm sorry,

323
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,919
but these herbs have strict storage requirements.

324
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:39,639
We don't

325
00:15:39,919 --> 00:15:41,720
allow outsiders to get close,

326
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,720
let alone let you in.

327
00:15:43,919 --> 00:15:45,480
If the owner finds out,

328
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:47,000
I'll be in trouble.

329
00:15:47,559 --> 00:15:49,519
How would you be in trouble?

330
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,000
We'll just be in there for a while.

331
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,200
It won't take long.

332
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:54,240
We'll be out soon.

333
00:15:58,399 --> 00:15:59,360
I... this morning,

334
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,879
I might have eaten something bad.

335
00:16:00,919 --> 00:16:01,720
Please wait for me a moment.

336
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,759
Hurry up.

337
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,679
Hurry up.

338
00:16:11,519 --> 00:16:12,240
Young Master,

339
00:16:12,559 --> 00:16:14,600
there are indeed many rare treasures here.

340
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:15,440
How about

341
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,799
we buy some to take back?

342
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:18,919
No need to shout.

343
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:19,600
The people have already left.

344
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:20,559
Hurry up and look.
